+```text
+lake clean: exit 0, empty output
+lake build: exit 0
+Built Klean62Derivative.Prelude
+Built Klean62Derivative.Sorts
+Built Klean62Derivative.Inj
+Built Klean62Derivative.Lemmas
+Built Klean62Derivative.Func
